{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0098","fact_refs":[0],"question":"What macro-average f-score does UTCNN achieve on the Facebook stance classification task?","answer":"UTCNN achieves a 0.755 macro-average f-score across supportive, neutral, and unsupportive stance classes on Facebook data."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0098","fact_refs":[1],"question":"What accuracy does UTCNN achieve on English online debate forum data?","answer":"UTCNN achieves 0.842 accuracy on the English online debate forum data."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0098","fact_refs":[2],"question":"What three types of non-text information does UTCNN incorporate for stance classification?","answer":"UTCNN incorporates user tastes, topic tastes, and user comments on posts."}
{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0098","fact_refs":[3],"question":"Besides social media, what other types of platforms can UTCNN analyze text from?","answer":"UTCNN can also analyze texts in forums and message boards."}
